graph LR
    KT["rhoai-konflux-tasks<br/>(CI/CD Task Library)"]

    %% External Dependencies (Required)
    KT -->|task/pipeline API| Tekton["Tekton Pipelines v1"]
    KT -->|upstream tasks<br/>(digest-pinned bundles)| KonfluxCatalog["Konflux CI<br/>Task Catalog"]
    KT -->|image building| Buildah["buildah v1.31.0+"]
    KT -->|secret scanning| Leaktk["leaktk-scanner"]
    KT -->|OCI artifact push/pull| ORAS["ORAS"]
    KT -->|image inspection| Skopeo["skopeo"]
    KT -->|attestation download| Cosign["cosign"]
    KT -->|YAML processing| Yq["yq v4.44.3"]
    KT -->|manifest processing| OperatorProcessor["operator-processor<br/>(Python tool)"]

    %% External Dependencies (Optional)
    KT -.->|bundle ref updates<br/>(automerge)| Renovate["Renovate"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    KT -->|clones tool| RKAutomation["RHOAI-Konflux-<br/>Automation"]
    KT -->|clone + workflow dispatch| ODHBuildConfig["ODH-Build-Config"]
    KT -->|commit comment trigger| Operator["opendatahub-operator"]
    KT -->|image mirror/snapshot/sealights| QuayRHOAI["Quay.io<br/>(rhoai namespace)"]

    %% Upstream Konflux Tasks (consumed via bundles)
    KonfluxCatalog -->|init| KC_Init["init"]
    KonfluxCatalog -->|git-clone-oci-ta| KC_Clone["git-clone-oci-ta"]
    KonfluxCatalog -->|buildah-oci-ta| KC_Buildah["buildah-oci-ta"]
    KonfluxCatalog -->|clair-scan| KC_Clair["clair-scan"]
    KonfluxCatalog -->|clamav-scan| KC_ClamAV["clamav-scan"]
    KonfluxCatalog -->|sast-snyk-check-oci-ta| KC_Snyk["sast-snyk-check"]

    %% External Services
    KT -->|REST API| GitHubAPI["GitHub API"]
    KT -->|webhooks| SlackAPI["Slack"]

